The maximum distance the game will let you go down without doing the
quest is only one level less than the maximum distance it will let you
go down post-quest. :)

A little spoily perhaps:

You could try taking advantage of regenerating (trolls) or splitting
monsters (puddings) to get more stuff to kill, or any kinds of create
monster effects. You can also revive high-XP monsters with 'turn
undead' (wand; and IIRC spell also). If you're not opposed to
deliberate reverse-genocide, sea creatures are worth a lot of XP (they
get a 1,000 point bonus simply for being sea creatures, apparently)
and are easy to kill on land.

